menu "MagTag Timer"

    config MAGTAG_SYNC_LED_FEEDBACK
        bool "NeoPixel feedback during NTP sync"
        default y
        help
            Show blue on the NeoPixels while WiFi is up and SNTP sync is in
            progress, and blink red three times if the sync fails. Useful
            during bring-up/debugging; disable for production builds
            (CONFIG_MAGTAG_SYNC_LED_FEEDBACK=n in sdkconfig.defaults).

    config MAGTAG_PARENT_TESTING
        bool "Button B manually resets the timer"
        default y
        help
            Testing convenience: Button B resets the timer to IDLE with the
            full daily allocation. Disable for production builds so the
            allocation only resets on day rollover — otherwise the timer's
            user could refund their own screen time.

endmenu
